{"title":"蓝桥杯专题：优美的数组","slug":"2024-04-08-优美的数组","date":"2024-04-07T19:40:38.000Z","updated":"2026-05-14T05:50:12.149Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2024-04-08-优美的数组.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<h2 id=\"问题描述\"><a href=\"#问题描述\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"问题描述\"></a>问题描述</h2><p>给定一个长度为 $n$ 的数组 $a$，数组中的元素分别为 $a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$。数组中的每一个元素都有一个<strong>美丽值</strong>。</p>\n<p>美丽值的定义如下：<br>假设当前元素为 $a_i$：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>该元素位置左侧第一个<strong>严格小于</strong> $a_i$ 的元素的值为 $x$，如果不存在则 $x=0$。</li>\n<li>该元素位置右侧第一个<strong>严格大于</strong> $a_i$ 的元素的值为 $y$，如果不存在则 $y=0$。</li>\n<li>$a_i$ 的美丽值定义为 $x \\times y$。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>给定一个整数 $m$，如果数组 $a$ 所有元素的美丽值之和至少为 $m$，那么整个数组是优美的，否则不是。</p>\n<h2 id=\"输入格式\"><a href=\"#输入格式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"输入格式\"></a>输入格式</h2><p>第一行包含两个正整数 $n, m$，其含义如上所述。<br>第二行包含 $n$ 个正整数 $a_1, \\dots, a_n$，表示数组中的每一个元素。</p>\n<h2 id=\"输出格式\"><a href=\"#输出格式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"输出格式\"></a>输出格式</h2><p>输出仅包含 1 行。如果整个数组是优美的，则输出 <code>YES</code>，否则输出 <code>NO</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"样例输入\"><a href=\"#样例输入\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"样例输入\"></a>样例输入</h2><figure class=\"highlight text\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br><span class=\"line\">68</span><br><span class=\"line\">69</span><br><span class=\"line\">70</span><br><span class=\"line\">71</span><br><span class=\"line\">72</span><br><span class=\"line\">73</span><br><span class=\"line\">74</span><br><span class=\"line\">75</span><br><span class=\"line\">76</span><br><span class=\"line\">77</span><br><span class=\"line\">78</span><br><span class=\"line\">79</span><br><span class=\"line\">80</span><br><span class=\"line\">81</span><br><span class=\"line\">82</span><br><span class=\"line\">83</span><br><span class=\"line\">84</span><br><span class=\"line\">85</span><br><span class=\"line\">86</span><br><span class=\"line\">87</span><br><span class=\"line\">88</span><br><span class=\"line\">89</span><br><span class=\"line\">90</span><br><span class=\"line\">91</span><br><span class=\"line\">92</span><br><span class=\"line\">93</span><br><span class=\"line\">94</span><br><span class=\"line\">95</span><br><span class=\"line\">96</span><br><span class=\"line\">97</span><br><span class=\"line\">98</span><br><span class=\"line\">99</span><br><span class=\"line\">100</span><br><span class=\"line\">101</span><br><span class=\"line\">102</span><br><span class=\"line\">103</span><br><span class=\"line\">104</span><br><span class=\"line\">105</span><br><span class=\"line\">106</span><br><span class=\"line\">107</span><br><span class=\"line\">108</span><br><span class=\"line\">109</span><br><span class=\"line\">110</span><br><span class=\"line\">111</span><br><span class=\"line\">112</span><br><span class=\"line\">113</span><br><span class=\"line\">114</span><br><span class=\"line\">115</span><br><span class=\"line\">116</span><br><span class=\"line\">117</span><br><span class=\"line\">118</span><br><span class=\"line\">119</span><br><span class=\"line\">120</span><br><span class=\"line\">121</span><br><span class=\"line\">122</span><br><span class=\"line\">123</span><br><span class=\"line\">124</span><br><span class=\"line\">125</span><br><span class=\"line\">126</span><br><span class=\"line\">127</span><br><span class=\"line\">128</span><br><span class=\"line\">129</span><br><span class=\"line\">130</span><br><span class=\"line\">131</span><br><span class=\"line\">132</span><br><span class=\"line\">133</span><br><span class=\"line\">134</span><br><span class=\"line\">135</span><br><span class=\"line\">136</span><br><span class=\"line\">137</span><br><span class=\"line\">138</span><br><span class=\"line\">139</span><br><span class=\"line\">140</span><br><span class=\"line\">141</span><br><span class=\"line\">142</span><br><span class=\"line\">143</span><br><span class=\"line\">144</span><br><span class=\"line\">145</span><br><span class=\"line\">146</span><br><span class=\"line\">147</span><br><span class=\"line\">148</span><br><span class=\"line\">149</span><br><span class=\"line\">150</span><br><span class=\"line\">151</span><br><span class=\"line\">152</span><br><span class=\"line\">153</span><br><span class=\"line\">154</span><br><span class=\"line\">155</span><br><span class=\"line\">156</span><br><span class=\"line\">157</span><br><span class=\"line\">158</span><br><span class=\"line\">159</span><br><span class=\"line\">160</span><br><span class=\"line\">161</span><br><span class=\"line\">162</span><br><span class=\"line\">163</span><br><span class=\"line\">164</span><br><span class=\"line\">165</span><br><span class=\"line\">166</span><br><span class=\"line\">167</span><br><span class=\"line\">168</span><br><span class=\"line\">169</span><br><span class=\"line\">170</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">5 10</span><br><span class=\"line\">1 2 3 4 5</span><br><span class=\"line\">&gt; **注意**：原题面中的样例输入存在排版缺失，基于题目逻辑和样例解释推导，正确的输入应为上述所示（数组为 1 2 3 4 5）。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">## 样例输出</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```text</span><br><span class=\"line\">YES</span><br><span class=\"line\">## 样例解析</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">根据题目定义，我们手动计算样例中每个元素的美丽值：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">1.  **第一个元素 (1)**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   左侧无更小元素，$x=0$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   右侧第一个大于 1 的元素是 2，$y=2$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   美丽值 = $0 \\times 2 = 0$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   *(注：题面说明中提到第一个元素美丽值为0，结论一致)*</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">2.  **第二个元素 (2)**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   左侧第一个小于 2 的元素是 1，$x=1$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   右侧第一个大于 2 的元素是 3，$y=3$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   美丽值 = $1 \\times 3 = 3$。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">3.  **第三个元素 (3)**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   左侧第一个小于 3 的元素是 2，$x=2$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   右侧第一个大于 3 的元素是 4，$y=4$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   美丽值 = $2 \\times 4 = 8$。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">4.  **第四个元素 (4)**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   左侧第一个小于 4 的元素是 3，$x=3$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   右侧第一个大于 4 的元素是 5，$y=5$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   美丽值 = $3 \\times 5 = 15$。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">5.  **第五个元素 (5)**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   左侧第一个小于 5 的元素是 4，$x=4$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   右侧无更大元素，$y=0$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   美丽值 = $4 \\times 0 = 0$。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">**总美丽值** = $0 + 3 + 8 + 15 + 0 = 26$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">因为 $26 \\ge 10$，所以输出 `YES`。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">## 评测数据规模</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">对于 $100\\%$ 的评测数据：</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   $1 &lt; n &lt; 10^5$</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   $1 \\le a_i \\le 10^9$ (推测值)</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   $1 \\le m &lt; 10^&#123;18&#125;$</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">---</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">## 解题思路与算法分析</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">### 1. 核心难点</span><br><span class=\"line\">对于每个元素 $a_i$，我们需要找到两个值：</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   左侧第一个比它小的元素（记为 $L_i$）。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   右侧第一个比它大的元素（记为 $R_i$）。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">如果使用暴力解法，对于每个元素向左右两边扫描，最坏情况下时间复杂度为 $O(N^2)$。考虑到 $N$ 可达 $10^5$，$O(N^2)$ 的算法会导致超时。因此，我们需要一种 $O(N)$ 或 $O(N \\log N)$ 的算法。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">### 2. 优化方案：单调栈</span><br><span class=\"line\">**单调栈** 是解决此类“寻找左侧/右侧第一个满足某种条件（大于/小于）元素”问题的经典数据结构。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">我们需要进行两次扫描：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">**第一步：寻找左侧第一个严格小于当前元素的值**</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   维护一个**单调递增栈**（栈底到栈顶元素值递增）。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   从左向右遍历数组 $a$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   对于当前元素 $a_i$，若栈顶元素 $\\ge a_i$，则弹出栈顶（因为栈顶元素对于 $a_i$ 及其右侧元素来说，不可能成为“左侧更小值”，被 $a_i$ 挡住了）。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   弹出结束后，若栈不为空，栈顶元素即为 $a_i$ 左侧第一个严格小于 $a_i$ 的值；若栈为空，则不存在，记为 0。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   将 $a_i$ 压入栈中。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">**第二步：寻找右侧第一个严格大于当前元素的值**</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   维护一个**单调递减栈**（栈底到栈顶元素值递减）。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   从右向左遍历数组 $a$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   对于当前元素 $a_i$，若栈顶元素 $\\le a_i$，则弹出栈顶。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   弹出结束后，若栈不为空，栈顶元素即为 $a_i$ 右侧第一个严格大于 $a_i$ 的值；若栈为空，则不存在，记为 0。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   将 $a_i$ 压入栈中。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">**第三步：计算总和**</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   将两次扫描得到的结果相乘并累加，判断是否大于等于 $m$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   注意：结果可能超过 `int` 范围，需使用 `long long`。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">### 3. 复杂度分析</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   **时间复杂度**：$O(N)$。每个元素最多进栈一次、出栈一次。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   **空间复杂度**：$O(N)$。需要额外的数组存储结果及栈空间。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">## 代码实现 (C++)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```cpp</span><br><span class=\"line\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">#include &lt;vector&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">#include &lt;stack&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">using namespace std;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">int main() &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 优化 I/O 效率</span><br><span class=\"line\">    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);</span><br><span class=\"line\">    cin.tie(nullptr);</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    int n;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    long long m; // m 可能很大</span><br><span class=\"line\">    if (!(cin &gt;&gt; n &gt;&gt; m)) return 0;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    vector&lt;int&gt; a(n);</span><br><span class=\"line\">    for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; ++i) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        cin &gt;&gt; a[i];</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 存储每个元素左侧/右侧的目标值</span><br><span class=\"line\">    vector&lt;int&gt; left_val(n, 0);</span><br><span class=\"line\">    vector&lt;int&gt; right_val(n, 0);</span><br><span class=\"line\">    stack&lt;int&gt; s;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 1. 寻找左侧第一个严格小于 a[i] 的元素</span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 栈维护单调递增序列</span><br><span class=\"line\">    for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; ++i) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        // 弹出所有 &gt;= a[i] 的元素，保持严格小于</span><br><span class=\"line\">        while (!s.empty() &amp;&amp; a[s.top()] &gt;= a[i]) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">            s.pop();</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        if (!s.empty()) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">            left_val[i] = a[s.top()];</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &#125; else &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">            left_val[i] = 0; // 不存在则为 0</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        s.push(i);</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 清空栈以备下次使用</span><br><span class=\"line\">    while (!s.empty()) s.pop();</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 2. 寻找右侧第一个严格大于 a[i] 的元素</span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 栈维护单调递减序列</span><br><span class=\"line\">    for (int i = n - 1; i &gt;= 0; --i) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        // 弹出所有 &lt;= a[i] 的元素，保持严格大于</span><br><span class=\"line\">        while (!s.empty() &amp;&amp; a[s.top()] &lt;= a[i]) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">            s.pop();</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        if (!s.empty()) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">            right_val[i] = a[s.top()];</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &#125; else &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">            right_val[i] = 0; // 不存在则为 0</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        s.push(i);</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 3. 计算总美丽值</span><br><span class=\"line\">    long long total_beauty = 0;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; ++i) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        total_beauty += (long long)left_val[i] * right_val[i];</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 4. 判断并输出</span><br><span class=\"line\">    if (total_beauty &gt;= m) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        cout &lt;&lt; &quot;YES&quot; &lt;&lt; endl;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125; else &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        cout &lt;&lt; &quot;NO&quot; &lt;&lt; endl;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    return 0;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">## 易错点提示</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">1.  **数据类型**：题目中 $m$ 可达 $10^&#123;18&#125;$，且美丽值为两数乘积，累加后可能溢出 `int` 甚至 `long long` 的中间计算过程。务必使用 `long long` 存储总美丽值和 $m$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">2.  **严格条件**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   左侧找“严格小于”，栈弹出条件是 `&gt;=`。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   右侧找“严格大于”，栈弹出条件是 `&lt;=`。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   如果条件判断错误（例如写成了非严格不等），会导致错误答案。</span><br><span class=\"line\">3.  **边界处理**：当栈为空时，代表没有满足条件的元素，此时值应赋为 0，而非未定义行为。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","more":"<h2 id=\"问题描述\"><a href=\"#问题描述\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"问题描述\"></a>问题描述</h2><p>给定一个长度为 $n$ 的数组 $a$，数组中的元素分别为 $a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$。数组中的每一个元素都有一个<strong>美丽值</strong>。</p>\n<p>美丽值的定义如下：<br>假设当前元素为 $a_i$：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>该元素位置左侧第一个<strong>严格小于</strong> $a_i$ 的元素的值为 $x$，如果不存在则 $x=0$。</li>\n<li>该元素位置右侧第一个<strong>严格大于</strong> $a_i$ 的元素的值为 $y$，如果不存在则 $y=0$。</li>\n<li>$a_i$ 的美丽值定义为 $x \\times y$。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>给定一个整数 $m$，如果数组 $a$ 所有元素的美丽值之和至少为 $m$，那么整个数组是优美的，否则不是。</p>\n<h2 id=\"输入格式\"><a href=\"#输入格式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"输入格式\"></a>输入格式</h2><p>第一行包含两个正整数 $n, m$，其含义如上所述。<br>第二行包含 $n$ 个正整数 $a_1, \\dots, a_n$，表示数组中的每一个元素。</p>\n<h2 id=\"输出格式\"><a href=\"#输出格式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"输出格式\"></a>输出格式</h2><p>输出仅包含 1 行。如果整个数组是优美的，则输出 <code>YES</code>，否则输出 <code>NO</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"样例输入\"><a href=\"#样例输入\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"样例输入\"></a>样例输入</h2><figure class=\"highlight text\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br><span class=\"line\">68</span><br><span class=\"line\">69</span><br><span class=\"line\">70</span><br><span class=\"line\">71</span><br><span class=\"line\">72</span><br><span class=\"line\">73</span><br><span class=\"line\">74</span><br><span class=\"line\">75</span><br><span class=\"line\">76</span><br><span class=\"line\">77</span><br><span class=\"line\">78</span><br><span class=\"line\">79</span><br><span class=\"line\">80</span><br><span class=\"line\">81</span><br><span class=\"line\">82</span><br><span class=\"line\">83</span><br><span class=\"line\">84</span><br><span class=\"line\">85</span><br><span class=\"line\">86</span><br><span class=\"line\">87</span><br><span class=\"line\">88</span><br><span class=\"line\">89</span><br><span class=\"line\">90</span><br><span class=\"line\">91</span><br><span class=\"line\">92</span><br><span class=\"line\">93</span><br><span class=\"line\">94</span><br><span class=\"line\">95</span><br><span class=\"line\">96</span><br><span class=\"line\">97</span><br><span class=\"line\">98</span><br><span class=\"line\">99</span><br><span class=\"line\">100</span><br><span class=\"line\">101</span><br><span class=\"line\">102</span><br><span class=\"line\">103</span><br><span class=\"line\">104</span><br><span class=\"line\">105</span><br><span class=\"line\">106</span><br><span class=\"line\">107</span><br><span class=\"line\">108</span><br><span class=\"line\">109</span><br><span class=\"line\">110</span><br><span class=\"line\">111</span><br><span class=\"line\">112</span><br><span class=\"line\">113</span><br><span class=\"line\">114</span><br><span class=\"line\">115</span><br><span class=\"line\">116</span><br><span class=\"line\">117</span><br><span class=\"line\">118</span><br><span class=\"line\">119</span><br><span class=\"line\">120</span><br><span class=\"line\">121</span><br><span class=\"line\">122</span><br><span class=\"line\">123</span><br><span class=\"line\">124</span><br><span class=\"line\">125</span><br><span class=\"line\">126</span><br><span class=\"line\">127</span><br><span class=\"line\">128</span><br><span class=\"line\">129</span><br><span class=\"line\">130</span><br><span class=\"line\">131</span><br><span class=\"line\">132</span><br><span class=\"line\">133</span><br><span class=\"line\">134</span><br><span class=\"line\">135</span><br><span class=\"line\">136</span><br><span class=\"line\">137</span><br><span class=\"line\">138</span><br><span class=\"line\">139</span><br><span class=\"line\">140</span><br><span class=\"line\">141</span><br><span class=\"line\">142</span><br><span class=\"line\">143</span><br><span class=\"line\">144</span><br><span class=\"line\">145</span><br><span class=\"line\">146</span><br><span class=\"line\">147</span><br><span class=\"line\">148</span><br><span class=\"line\">149</span><br><span class=\"line\">150</span><br><span class=\"line\">151</span><br><span class=\"line\">152</span><br><span class=\"line\">153</span><br><span class=\"line\">154</span><br><span class=\"line\">155</span><br><span class=\"line\">156</span><br><span class=\"line\">157</span><br><span class=\"line\">158</span><br><span class=\"line\">159</span><br><span class=\"line\">160</span><br><span class=\"line\">161</span><br><span class=\"line\">162</span><br><span class=\"line\">163</span><br><span class=\"line\">164</span><br><span class=\"line\">165</span><br><span class=\"line\">166</span><br><span class=\"line\">167</span><br><span class=\"line\">168</span><br><span class=\"line\">169</span><br><span class=\"line\">170</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">5 10</span><br><span class=\"line\">1 2 3 4 5</span><br><span class=\"line\">&gt; **注意**：原题面中的样例输入存在排版缺失，基于题目逻辑和样例解释推导，正确的输入应为上述所示（数组为 1 2 3 4 5）。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">## 样例输出</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```text</span><br><span class=\"line\">YES</span><br><span class=\"line\">## 样例解析</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">根据题目定义，我们手动计算样例中每个元素的美丽值：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">1.  **第一个元素 (1)**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   左侧无更小元素，$x=0$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   右侧第一个大于 1 的元素是 2，$y=2$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   美丽值 = $0 \\times 2 = 0$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   *(注：题面说明中提到第一个元素美丽值为0，结论一致)*</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">2.  **第二个元素 (2)**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   左侧第一个小于 2 的元素是 1，$x=1$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   右侧第一个大于 2 的元素是 3，$y=3$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   美丽值 = $1 \\times 3 = 3$。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">3.  **第三个元素 (3)**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   左侧第一个小于 3 的元素是 2，$x=2$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   右侧第一个大于 3 的元素是 4，$y=4$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   美丽值 = $2 \\times 4 = 8$。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">4.  **第四个元素 (4)**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   左侧第一个小于 4 的元素是 3，$x=3$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   右侧第一个大于 4 的元素是 5，$y=5$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   美丽值 = $3 \\times 5 = 15$。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">5.  **第五个元素 (5)**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   左侧第一个小于 5 的元素是 4，$x=4$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   右侧无更大元素，$y=0$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   美丽值 = $4 \\times 0 = 0$。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">**总美丽值** = $0 + 3 + 8 + 15 + 0 = 26$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">因为 $26 \\ge 10$，所以输出 `YES`。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">## 评测数据规模</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">对于 $100\\%$ 的评测数据：</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   $1 &lt; n &lt; 10^5$</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   $1 \\le a_i \\le 10^9$ (推测值)</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   $1 \\le m &lt; 10^&#123;18&#125;$</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">---</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">## 解题思路与算法分析</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">### 1. 核心难点</span><br><span class=\"line\">对于每个元素 $a_i$，我们需要找到两个值：</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   左侧第一个比它小的元素（记为 $L_i$）。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   右侧第一个比它大的元素（记为 $R_i$）。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">如果使用暴力解法，对于每个元素向左右两边扫描，最坏情况下时间复杂度为 $O(N^2)$。考虑到 $N$ 可达 $10^5$，$O(N^2)$ 的算法会导致超时。因此，我们需要一种 $O(N)$ 或 $O(N \\log N)$ 的算法。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">### 2. 优化方案：单调栈</span><br><span class=\"line\">**单调栈** 是解决此类“寻找左侧/右侧第一个满足某种条件（大于/小于）元素”问题的经典数据结构。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">我们需要进行两次扫描：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">**第一步：寻找左侧第一个严格小于当前元素的值**</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   维护一个**单调递增栈**（栈底到栈顶元素值递增）。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   从左向右遍历数组 $a$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   对于当前元素 $a_i$，若栈顶元素 $\\ge a_i$，则弹出栈顶（因为栈顶元素对于 $a_i$ 及其右侧元素来说，不可能成为“左侧更小值”，被 $a_i$ 挡住了）。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   弹出结束后，若栈不为空，栈顶元素即为 $a_i$ 左侧第一个严格小于 $a_i$ 的值；若栈为空，则不存在，记为 0。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   将 $a_i$ 压入栈中。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">**第二步：寻找右侧第一个严格大于当前元素的值**</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   维护一个**单调递减栈**（栈底到栈顶元素值递减）。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   从右向左遍历数组 $a$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   对于当前元素 $a_i$，若栈顶元素 $\\le a_i$，则弹出栈顶。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   弹出结束后，若栈不为空，栈顶元素即为 $a_i$ 右侧第一个严格大于 $a_i$ 的值；若栈为空，则不存在，记为 0。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   将 $a_i$ 压入栈中。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">**第三步：计算总和**</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   将两次扫描得到的结果相乘并累加，判断是否大于等于 $m$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   注意：结果可能超过 `int` 范围，需使用 `long long`。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">### 3. 复杂度分析</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   **时间复杂度**：$O(N)$。每个元素最多进栈一次、出栈一次。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   **空间复杂度**：$O(N)$。需要额外的数组存储结果及栈空间。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">## 代码实现 (C++)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```cpp</span><br><span class=\"line\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">#include &lt;vector&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">#include &lt;stack&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">using namespace std;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">int main() &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 优化 I/O 效率</span><br><span class=\"line\">    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);</span><br><span class=\"line\">    cin.tie(nullptr);</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    int n;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    long long m; // m 可能很大</span><br><span class=\"line\">    if (!(cin &gt;&gt; n &gt;&gt; m)) return 0;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    vector&lt;int&gt; a(n);</span><br><span class=\"line\">    for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; ++i) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        cin &gt;&gt; a[i];</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 存储每个元素左侧/右侧的目标值</span><br><span class=\"line\">    vector&lt;int&gt; left_val(n, 0);</span><br><span class=\"line\">    vector&lt;int&gt; right_val(n, 0);</span><br><span class=\"line\">    stack&lt;int&gt; s;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 1. 寻找左侧第一个严格小于 a[i] 的元素</span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 栈维护单调递增序列</span><br><span class=\"line\">    for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; ++i) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        // 弹出所有 &gt;= a[i] 的元素，保持严格小于</span><br><span class=\"line\">        while (!s.empty() &amp;&amp; a[s.top()] &gt;= a[i]) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">            s.pop();</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        if (!s.empty()) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">            left_val[i] = a[s.top()];</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &#125; else &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">            left_val[i] = 0; // 不存在则为 0</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        s.push(i);</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 清空栈以备下次使用</span><br><span class=\"line\">    while (!s.empty()) s.pop();</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 2. 寻找右侧第一个严格大于 a[i] 的元素</span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 栈维护单调递减序列</span><br><span class=\"line\">    for (int i = n - 1; i &gt;= 0; --i) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        // 弹出所有 &lt;= a[i] 的元素，保持严格大于</span><br><span class=\"line\">        while (!s.empty() &amp;&amp; a[s.top()] &lt;= a[i]) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">            s.pop();</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        if (!s.empty()) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">            right_val[i] = a[s.top()];</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &#125; else &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">            right_val[i] = 0; // 不存在则为 0</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        s.push(i);</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 3. 计算总美丽值</span><br><span class=\"line\">    long long total_beauty = 0;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; ++i) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        total_beauty += (long long)left_val[i] * right_val[i];</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 4. 判断并输出</span><br><span class=\"line\">    if (total_beauty &gt;= m) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        cout &lt;&lt; &quot;YES&quot; &lt;&lt; endl;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125; else &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        cout &lt;&lt; &quot;NO&quot; &lt;&lt; endl;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    return 0;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">## 易错点提示</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">1.  **数据类型**：题目中 $m$ 可达 $10^&#123;18&#125;$，且美丽值为两数乘积，累加后可能溢出 `int` 甚至 `long long` 的中间计算过程。务必使用 `long long` 存储总美丽值和 $m$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">2.  **严格条件**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   左侧找“严格小于”，栈弹出条件是 `&gt;=`。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   右侧找“严格大于”，栈弹出条件是 `&lt;=`。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   如果条件判断错误（例如写成了非严格不等），会导致错误答案。</span><br><span class=\"line\">3.  **边界处理**：当栈为空时，代表没有满足条件的元素，此时值应赋为 0，而非未定义行为。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","categories":[{"name":"算法刷题","path":"api/categories/算法刷题.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"LanQiao","path":"api/tags/LanQiao.json"},{"name":"算法","path":"api/tags/算法.json"},{"name":"数据结构","path":"api/tags/数据结构.json"},{"name":"单调栈","path":"api/tags/单调栈.json"}]}